AUDIO: '&gt;&gt; Before we film our first shot, we\'re going to go through the settings next. So the settings I recommend for the Go Ultra &gt;&gt; Mhm. &gt;&gt; is one you can set and forget. &gt;&gt; Okay. &gt;&gt; So once you set these settings, you can just use the camera all day and don\'t'

[01:55] [scene:ui]
VISUAL: Shanno demonstrates the camera settings, showing resolution (4K), frame rate (30), Active HDR, and stabilization (low).
AUDIO: 'worry about it during the day. &gt;&gt; Mhm. &gt;&gt; I would set the bit rate to high. This will give you the best video quality possible. You always want to be filming in video mode during the day. Set the resolution to 4K, and the frame rate to'

[02:07] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: '30 frames per second. This is perfect for YouTube. &gt;&gt; Mhm. &gt;&gt; And you want to set active HDR to on, and the stabilization is set to low. So, we\'re going to see a little bit of'

[02:20] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'camera shake, so it looks and feels a bit more natural. &gt;&gt; Mhm. &gt;&gt; You can set the stabilization to standard, but then the footage might look a little bit floaty. &gt;&gt; Okay. &gt;&gt; So, if you want it to look a little bit more natural, I prefer low'

[02:32] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'stabilization. The field of view is how much distortion you want in the video. So, when I put it on ultra omega, you can see more of the warp, the fish eye effect.'

[02:44] [scene:ui]
VISUAL: Shanno shows the I-Log setting for a flat color profile and color preview.
AUDIO: '&gt;&gt; Yeah. &gt;&gt; But, if I put it on linear, then it straightens out all the lines, so it looks more like normal video. So, you don\'t get that action camera look. &gt;&gt; Yeah. &gt;&gt; When I swipe left from the right of the screen, you have the exposure settings. I like to put it in manual.'

[02:57] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: '&gt;&gt; Mhm. &gt;&gt; I have I log set to on, and this is a flat color profile &gt;&gt; Mhm. &gt;&gt; that gives you unprocessed video. &gt;&gt; Mhm. &gt;&gt; And it\'s going to give you natural'

[03:09] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'looking video. The ISO is set to 100, which will give you a really clean video without noise and grain. The EV is set to minus 0.3. And on a bright sunny day like this, it\'s going to protect the bright areas'

