AUDIO: 'of the video, so it\'s not blown out. &gt;&gt; Yeah. &gt;&gt; Especially like near the sun. And then, the shutter speed is set to auto, so when we move in between the shady and bright areas, the camera will adjust automatically for us. So, in the shade,'

[03:35] [scene:talk]
